  "why": "the 22 migrated binders PLUS depth_test.py:27 and depth_test2.py:32, which bind main's legacy record by ABSOLUTE literal and exist in all four trees at the same line. The inherited 22/21/20/20 was the count of a NARROWER PATTERN, not of the binders. TARGET 0, to be reached by t_86fa52a2 (the depth files + darts/darts.py).",
  "landed_by": "the Chair's ruling on t_5742bdac, 2026-10-14-a-writer-is-bound-by-its-destination-not-its-syntax.md, sha256 6309d8a467ccdbc2317e904f98a6222c37f2678f17f2c4e8567d87b5f52232f9",
